# Frontend constitution

Read [docs/FRONTEND.md](docs/FRONTEND.md) and [docs/PROGRESS.md](docs/PROGRESS.md) before any UI. Customer Expo app lives in `frontend/`; jeweler admin is dual — Expo `frontend/app/admin/` (phone) and Next.js `admin/` (dense ERP).

## Three languages

- **Storefront** — Expo white-label luxury retail. Imagery, type, space. Tokens from bootstrap / [docs/THEMING.md](docs/THEMING.md).
- **Jeweler admin** — Stripe / Linear density (interim Expo `/admin`; target Next.js). Platform tokens. Tenant logo is orientation only.
- **Platform console** — Vercel / Railway control. Not built yet. No vanity KPI card walls.

Never restyle admin as the storefront preset. Never put ERP tables on the shop.

## Tokens

Storefront: `var(--color-primary)` (and the rest of the THEMING contract).  
Forbidden for brand: `text-blue-600`, `#C9A227`, hardcoded fonts.

## Before any screen

Who, primary goal, required action, what matters most, fastest workflow.

## Reject

Four equal metric cards as a dashboard. Card-in-card. Purple gradients. Global customer SSO UI. Platform payment branding on checkout.
